{"id":90,"slug":"ma-jain-zh","resourceId":56,"nameNative":"马坚译（中文）","nameAr":"ما جيان","nameEn":"Chinese Translation (Ma Jian)","lang":"zh","source":"Quran.com API v4","sourceUrl":"https://quran.com","verses":[{"verseNumber":1,"verseKey":"90:1","text":"我以这个地方盟誓--"},{"verseNumber":2,"verseKey":"90:2","text":"你将在那里，不受羁束--"},{"verseNumber":3,"verseKey":"90:3","text":"我以一个父亲和他所生的子孙盟誓，"},{"verseNumber":4,"verseKey":"90:4","text":"我确已把人创造在苦难里。"},{"verseNumber":5,"verseKey":"90:5","text":"他以为任何人都不能制裁他吗？"},{"verseNumber":6,"verseKey":"90:6","text":"他说：我花费了许多财产！"},{"verseNumber":7,"verseKey":"90:7","text":"他以为任何人都没有看见他吗？"},{"verseNumber":8,"verseKey":"90:8","text":"难道我没有为他创造两只眼睛、"},{"verseNumber":9,"verseKey":"90:9","text":"一条舌头、两片嘴唇，"},{"verseNumber":10,"verseKey":"90:10","text":"并指示他两条明显的道路吗？"},{"verseNumber":11,"verseKey":"90:11","text":"他怎麽不超越山径呢？"},{"verseNumber":12,"verseKey":"90:12","text":"你怎能知道超越山径是什麽事？"},{"verseNumber":13,"verseKey":"90:13","text":"是释放奴隶，"},{"verseNumber":14,"verseKey":"90:14","text":"或在饥荒日赈济"},{"verseNumber":15,"verseKey":"90:15","text":"亲戚的孤儿，"},{"verseNumber":16,"verseKey":"90:16","text":"或困穷的贫民；"},{"verseNumber":17,"verseKey":"90:17","text":"同时，他是一个信道而且行善，并以坚忍相勉，以慈悯相助者。"},{"verseNumber":18,"verseKey":"90:18","text":"这等人是幸福的。"},{"verseNumber":19,"verseKey":"90:19","text":"不信我的迹象者，是薄命的，"},{"verseNumber":20,"verseKey":"90:20","text":"他们将被关在火狱里。"}]}